{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42460","headline":"寄暹上人 · 孟贯","name":"寄暹上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻罢城中讲，来安顶上禅。\n夜灯明石室，清磐出岩泉。\n欲访慙多事，相思恨隔年。\n终期息尘虑，接话虎溪边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟贯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}